---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import HeroSection from '../components/HeroSection.astro';
import LetsTalkSection from "../components/LetsTalkSection.astro";
---

<Layout hasNavbar={false}>
	<HeroSection/>
	<section class="flex flex-col
	px-6 py-11 gap-4
	md:p-24 md:gap-5">
		<div class="flex flex-col border-b-brand-light-gray border-b gap-4 pb-7">
			<div class="text-overline uppercase text-brand-primary">
				Lionheart Pacific
			</div>
			<div class="text-2xl md:text-h2">
				We’re unusually good at building software.
			</div>
			<div class="text-sm md:text-subtitle1 font-normal text-brand-dark-gray">
				That isn’t luck. It comes from how we work — pairing, test-driven development, continuous delivery, and
				engineers who think about product and design. These are the practices that separate excellent teams from
				merely competent ones.
			</div>
			<a href="/practices" class="text-overline text-brand-primary">
				See how we work →
			</a>
		</div>
		<div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
			<div class="text-2xl md:text-h2">
				And it’s built to last.
			</div>
			<div class="text-sm md:text-subtitle1 text-brand-dark-gray">
				You get the quality you’d expect from a premium firm — at a cost you can sustain for the long run. It comes from stable, dedicated teams; a delivery model built to last; and engineers in Thailand working with a U.S.-based Delivery Lead who stays close to your priorities.
			</div>
			<a href="/practices#how-we-build" class="text-overline text-brand-primary">
				Our approach  →
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>
	<section class="flex flex-col
	px-6 py-11 gap-4
	md:p-24
	border-t-brand-light-gray border-t">
		<div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
			<div class="text-overline uppercase">
				What we do
			</div>
			<div class="text-2xl md:text-h2">
				Product Development
			</div>
			<div class="text-sm md:text-subtitle1 text-brand-dark-gray">
				A team that takes ownership of meaningful work alongside you — without you building and managing a software organization to do it.
			</div>
			<div class="text-sm md:text-subtitle1 text-brand-mid-gray">
				For organizations where software has become core to the business — and who want a team they can hand it to, that stays aligned with their priorities.
			</div>
			<a href="/services" class="text-overline text-brand-primary">
				Explore services  →
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>


	<LetsTalkSection/>
	<!--<Services/>-->
</Layout>
